{"c":[{"id":"7f7ac3203ac0de40","sum":"2026-10-21: default connects never load vss for HNSW (ro or rw, killed-embed wal) on 1.5.4 and 2.0.0. Same-path connects share one instance and its vss. Validity segments stay Uncompressed or Constant under zstd; check VARCHAR/JSON segments. Zstd copy 288 MiB vs 483 without.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261022T043948Z-dab6d7cbfdabf68a","text":"Measured 2026-10-21: engine-default connects (autoload+autoinstall on) never load vss for a file with the HNSW index, ro or rw, with a killed embed's wal, on 1.5.4 and 2.0.0. Same-path connects in one process share one instance and its loaded vss.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T043949Z-fa23510e4a10474a","text":"pragma_storage_info lists VALIDITY segments under the column name, Uncompressed or Constant even with zstd forced; check zstd on VARCHAR/JSON segments. Live tables copy to 288 MiB with zstd vs 483 MiB without on 2.0.0 (measured 2026-10-21).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"099f55a26a5a6c59","sum":"2026-10-22: swap is check phase B. Phase A records rehearsed. Phase B, a day or more later: copy, verify, hard-link backup, replace. No swap release. Exact top-100 rank-cut-join: 220 ms on 1.5.4, ~160 ms on 2.0.0 (133,793 vectors); EXISTS 689/320 ms; join-first QUALIFY 1.7/2.0 s.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261022T125611Z-032510e14baefd2f","text":"Operator 2026-10-22: the swap is phase B of the session-start check. Phase A records rehearsed; phase B runs at a later session start, at least a day after a rehearsed record of the same check version: copy again, verify, hard-link the backup, replace. No swap release.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T131311Z-231ef0e08e22e082","text":"Exact semantic top-100 over 133,793 vectors, measured 2026-10-22: rank (min distance per owner), cut, then join messages takes 220 ms on 1.5.4 and ~160 ms on 2.0.0; an EXISTS orphan guard 689/320 ms; join-first QUALIFY 1.7/2.0 s.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
